# Code owners for adform/agentic-skills.
#
# All three contributors with write access own every critical path, so any one
# of them can approve another's PR. This is what makes `require_code_owner_review`
# viable — with a single owner, no PR could ever be approved.
#
# An owner listed here without write access is silently ignored by GitHub, so
# re-check permissions when someone joins or leaves. Longer term these should be
# an Adform Security or Engineering team rather than named individuals.
#
# Paths are ordered least- to most-specific; the last match wins.

*                                   @surensilva @haferjir @ehrma

# Install entrypoint. A change here can repoint the marketplace at any source.
/.claude-plugin/                    @surensilva @haferjir @ehrma

# Source of truth for skill content — where a malicious edit would be authored.
/dist/generic/                      @surensilva @haferjir @ehrma

# Build output that is committed and actually shipped to installers.
/plugins/                           @surensilva @haferjir @ehrma
/dist/claude/                       @surensilva @haferjir @ehrma

# Anything that can execute during a build or in CI.
/build-plugin.sh                    @surensilva @haferjir @ehrma
/.github/                           @surensilva @haferjir @ehrma
